  "setup": "Intel Arc B390 with 64 GB unified RAM; requires 48 GB available system RAM. CPU and GPU share RAM. Build the pinned source first (the SYCL compiler is in the base image). Original Inkling-2-Mini checkpoint served natively: NVFP4 experts (layers 0-19) and MXFP8 experts (layers 20-23) through SYCL GEMV/dequant kernels, INT8 group-32 dense weights for decode, FP8 E4M3 KV for the 8 global-attention passes of the looped core, model-owned sliding-window and short-conv rings, image input, Inkling reasoning/tool parsers. Up to 4 concurrent requests, each up to 262,144 tokens (KV pool 1,052,672 tokens). Prefix caching is disabled (per-request recurrent rings). No speculative decoding yet. Drain active requests before stopping.",
  "source": "https://github.com/sybil-solutions/local-ai-registry/tree/__REGISTRY_COMMIT__/data/sources/inkling2-mini-b390"
